      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we’re making Gemini 4 Carbon available to developers, enterprises, scientists, and consumers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-is-now-available/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T16:03:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:32.729Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Following our recent launch of Gemini 4 Argon , Carbon pushes the frontier even further.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-is-now-available/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T16:03:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:32.729Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Carbon is available via the API in Google AI Studio and Gemini for business for all paying developers and enterprises, at the same introductory price",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-is-now-available/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T16:03:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:32.729Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Across legal, finance, and enterprise operations, Gemini 4 Carbon combines frontier visual understanding, reasoning, and exhaustive retrieval to synthesize grounded insights across large sets of dense documents and data.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-is-now-available/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T16:03:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:32.729Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Using Google Antigravity’s new /swarm feature, a team of Gemini 4 Carbon agents turned historical photos and engineering plates into an interactive Three.js 3D exhibition of the Eiffel Tower's 1887–1889 construction from a single prompt.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-is-now-available/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T16:03:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:32.729Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In Google Antigravity, Gemini 4 Carbon built an interactive multiscale textile visualizer based on an academic paper, modeling a virtual-fiber finite element framework with interactive 3D yarn meshes, 110-fiber polar tracking, and dynamic stress-strain curves with minimal prom…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-is-now-available/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T16:03:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:32.729Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Carbon for cyber delivers our strongest cybersecurity capabilities to date, giving security teams the end-to-end intelligence they need in protecting critical software.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-is-now-available/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T16:03:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:32.729Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For example, across 7 low-homolog protein families from the CASP17 blind test set, Carbon increased the number of homologs retrieved by 40-fold on average, greatly increasing the information available to structure prediction models without need for retraining.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-is-now-available/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T16:03:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:32.729Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "See the model card to learn more about Gemini 4 Carbon and to start building with it, explore our updated Gemini 4 developer guide and documentation for best practices on migrating workflows to the model.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-is-now-available/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T16:03:47.000Z",
